        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h3 class="anchor anchorTargetStickyNavbar_Vzrq" id="iot-考題紀錄">IoT 考題紀錄<a href="https://chwe12.github.io/blog/2025-11-12#iot-%E8%80%83%E9%A1%8C%E7%B4%80%E9%8C%84" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to IoT 考題紀錄" title="Direct link to IoT 考題紀錄" translate="no">​</a></h3>
<p>以下統整部分歷屆考題的比例分配重點。</p>
