        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h3 class="anchor anchorTargetStickyNavbar_Vzrq" id="arduino燒錄錯誤排除">arduino燒錄錯誤排除<a href="https://chwe12.github.io/blog/2025-09-09#arduino%E7%87%92%E9%8C%84%E9%8C%AF%E8%AA%A4%E6%8E%92%E9%99%A4" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to arduino燒錄錯誤排除" title="Direct link to arduino燒錄錯誤排除" translate="no">​</a></h3>
<ol>
<li class="">
<p>上課在教學燒錄arduino，用燒錄工具的時候出現一個奇怪的錯誤，問老師沒有答案，結果上網找一下原來要系統管理員打開: <br>
<a href="https://forums.balena.io/t/error-0-h-requestmetadata-is-not-a-function/371138/17" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">https://forums.balena.io/t/error-0-h-requestmetadata-is-not-a-function/371138/17</a><br>
好像也可以用之前燒錄SD的另一個tool win32diskmanager<br>
找了其他指令:<a href="https://korewa72.blogspot.com/2018/09/blog-post.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="">https://korewa72.blogspot.com/2018/09/blog-post.html</a> <br></p>
</li>
<li class="">
<p>原來燒錄時不用把下載下來的解壓縮，沒有仔細看副檔名，看到有壓縮的圖標就右鍵解壓縮下去了。<br></p>
</li>
</ol>]]></content>
